        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "For instance, the chloroform-soluble portion of Rg(Th-5,4/12) (x ) 69) exhibits a melting point $( T _ { \\mathrm { m } } )$at $1 9 7 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$on heating and a crystallization temperature $( T _ { \\mathrm { c } } )$at 169 °C on cooling, corresponding to a degree of supercooling (∆T) of $2 8 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$."
