        "source_sentence": "The X-ray diffraction patterns exhibit several sharp low-angle reflections corresponding to a well-ordered lamellar structure with interlayer distances ranging from 40.1 Å for the shortest homologue Rg(Th-5,4/4) up to 57.8 Å for the longest homologue Rg(Th-11,4/8)."
